Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:54:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] treble_app: download the ims apk without
 DownloadManager

the install button stays silent on some devices: DownloadManager stops
with FILE_ERROR before the apk lands and its retry then crashes
android.process.media. stream the apk straight into the installer
session instead and report failures in a toast.

the unsigned phh apks never install since only the phh signature is
trusted, so always fetch the resigned ones and drop the services.jar
reflection check.
